peccable, and their luxury standards are uncompromising.<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class=\"border-t border-gray-200 pt-6 mb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"relative w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0\"><img alt=\"Catherine Dubois\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/reviewer-3.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm\">Catherine Dubois</p><p class=\"text-xs text-amber-600 font-medium\">Luxury Hotel Owner</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Geneva, Switzerland</p></div></div></div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">2 weeks ago</p></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100\"><div class=\"h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600\"></div><div class=\"p-8\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote text-amber-200 mb-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex gap-1 mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star fill-amber-500 text-amber-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736